{
  "id": 531,
  "title": "数字孪生-智慧场馆",
  "date": "2024-01-05",
  "summary": "随着信息技术的发展，信息化和数字化管理政策已成为各种智能建筑和场馆的蓬勃发展方向之一。传统体育场馆正在向“智能”发展，建设集信息收集、信息整合、指挥调度、互联等功能于一体的智能场馆。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-531.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-12-27/202312271652493793.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  随着信息技术的发展，信息化和数字化管理政策已成为各种智能建筑和场馆的蓬勃发展方向之一。传统体育场馆正在向“智能”发展，建设集信息收集、信息整合、指挥调度、互联等功能于一体的智能场馆。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">我国大型场馆管理现状</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  缺乏行业管理，场馆设施软硬件不匹配，管理水平相对落后，场馆综合利用率低。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">智能场馆优势</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  1、强大的在线预订平台，利用互联网连接场地和人，为体育人群提供丰富的在线预订、活动发布、体育交流等服务，同时体验快速预订，带来新鲜的社会元素</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  2、完善会员管理、场地管理、赛事管理、培训管理、商品管理等基本功能，可巩固管理基础，大大降低场地管理工作量；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  3、强大的业务分析统计能力，一云多端布局可以随时随地监控场馆管理和业务状况，收入报表清晰，多开几个场馆也可以轻松管理</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  4、集成智能硬件、照明控制、门禁、运动直播、视频监控、WIFI管理等，通过数据采集和信息共享，促进场馆智能 化进程，降低运营成本</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  5、与微信后端无缝契合，会员实时消费提醒，根据管理者当天的营业数据，及时推送到世界各地，掌握场馆的营业情况，一切都在控制之中；</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  6、适用于羽毛球场、乒乓球场、网球场、高尔夫球场、健身房、滑雪场、滑冰场、卡丁体育场、篮球场、足球场、游泳池、武术场、保龄体育场、棒球场、台球场、瑜伽场等体育场馆，支持多类综合体育场馆和多场馆的连锁经营。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  7、服务人员劳动量可减少50%-70%，从而向销售市场等前端盈利部门释放更多劳动力，降低人力资源成本，提高劳动力产量，实现效益最大化。</span><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\" /><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">  8、节约场馆能耗，实现能效可视化、可诊断、可控，提供能源保障</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-1-5/202415927405031.png\" title=\"11\" alt=\"11\" /><br /><br /><br /></span></p>",
